{{define "content"}}
<section class="page-section">
    <h1>Security Disclosure Policy</h1>
    <p>Report suspected vulnerabilities privately and include enough detail to reproduce the issue. Do not access or modify data that is not yours, disrupt service, or disclose a vulnerability publicly before coordinating with the maintainers.</p>
    <h2>What to include</h2>
    <p>Describe the affected endpoint or component, the impact, and clear reproduction steps. Avoid including real personal data or credentials in a report.</p>
    <h2>Coordinated disclosure</h2>
    <p>We will acknowledge reports and work with researchers on a reasonable disclosure timeline. We may publish a security advisory after a fix is available.</p>
    <p><a href="{{.BaseURL}}/server/security">Security overview</a></p>
</section>
{{end}}
